{"sourceUrl":"https://jg.sicau.edu.cn/info/1059/8688.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:33.019927+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://jg.sicau.edu.cn/info/1059/8688.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>根据《</span><span>2027年招收推免研究生复试、录取工作办法（校研发【2026】37号）</span></span><span>》、《</span><span><span>关于</span><span>2027年接收推免研究生（含直博生）工作的通知</span></span><span><span>》（</span><span>https://yan.sicau.edu.cn/info/1025/18969.htm）</span></span><span><span>相关规定，现将我院</span><span>20</span></span><span>27</span><span>年接收推免生相关工作通知如下：</span></p><p><strong><span>一、组织与管理</span></strong></p><p><span>推免研究生招收工作由学院招生工作领导小组全程统筹管理和指导，</span><span>招生工作领导小组如下：</span></p><p><span><span>组</span>  <span>长：曹云忠</span></span></p><p><span><span>成</span>  <span>员：申</span> <span>琼</span></span><span>、</span><span>张凌青</span><span>、付  刚</span></p><p><span><span>秘</span>  <span>书：</span><span>张 敏</span></span></p><p><strong><span>二、推免生接收条件</span></strong></p><p><span>1.已取得本科就读高校的推荐免试资格者均可报名。</span></p><p><span>2.具有过硬的政治素质，社会责任感强，诚实守信，品行优良，积极向上，身心健康。</span></p><p><span>3.考生须具有较强的创新意识和创新能力，恪守学术道德规范。</span></p><p><strong><span>三、接收</span></strong><strong><span>硕士</span></strong><strong><span>学科点与人数</span></strong></p><p><span>1.城乡规划学 083300（学术</span><span>学位</span><span><span>）</span> </span><span>3</span><span>名</span></p><p><span>2.土木工程 085901（专业学位） </span><span>8</span><span>名</span></p><p><span>硕士</span><span>招生</span><span><span>专业目录网址：</span><span>https://yzb.sicau.edu.cn/zyml/zymls.aspx</span></span></p><p><strong><span>四、</span></strong><strong><span>具体</span></strong><strong><span>安排</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>1.报名</span></strong><span>：</span><span><span><span>从即日起到</span><span>9月20日以内。</span></span></span></p><p><span>凡有意愿报考</span><span>我</span><span>院且取得推免资格的同学，</span><span>请按以下流程报名：</span></p><p><span> 第一步：</span><span><span>在线填写</span><span>:【腾讯文档】四川农业大学建筑与城乡规划学院2027年接收推免研究生报名汇总表</span></span><span>：</span><span><a href=\"https://docs.qq.com/sheet/DUGpBWWRiZXNITE5D?tab=000001\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.qq.com/sheet/DUGpBWWRiZXNITE5D?tab=000001</a></span></p><p><span> <span>第二步：</span></span><span><span>请报名同学加入</span><span>“</span></span><span>2026下半年推免生接收群</span><span>”（群号：725545745），安排将在群里发布。</span></p><p><span> 第三步：</span><span>提交材料，</span><span>材料收集表单地址：</span><span><a href=\"https://f.kdocs.cn/g/hqmFqomI/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://f.kdocs.cn/g/hqmFqomI/</a> </span><span>其中：还需将</span><span>已获得在读学校推免资格证明（</span><span>可以是公示截图+链接</span><span>）pdf文档，命名为“推免接收</span><span>+</span><span>报考专业</span><span>+姓名</span><span>”发送到</span><a href=\"mailto:jcxy@sicau.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>jcxy@sicau.edu.cn</span></a><span>。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2. </span><strong><span>复试</span></strong><span>：采用线</span><span>上</span><span>的方式进行，复试全程录音录像，</span><span>线上</span><span>考生</span><span>需遵守</span><span>附件：</span><span>《</span><span>远程复试考场规则》。</span><span>复试相关</span><span>内容</span><span>属于涉密信息，考生复试过程中</span><span>自己</span><span>不得录音录像，不得对外透露或传播复试相关信息，如违反规定，将被取消录取资格，并计入个人诚信档案。</span></p><p><strong><span>复试内容</span></strong><strong><span>包括</span></strong><span>：重点考察考生相关专业的理论知识和实践技能，分析问题和解决问题的能力；创新精神、创新能力、科研潜力和科研道德；英语基础、口语和专业英语能力；以及口头表达能力和心理素质等。</span></p><p><span>复试</span><span>时间：</span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>02</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span>年</span><span>9月</span></span></span><span><span>22</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>周</span></span><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>上午</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>:00</span></span><span><span> <span>城乡规划学</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>02</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span>年</span><span>9月</span></span></span><span><span>22</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>周</span></span><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>下</span></span><span><span>午</span></span><span><span>14</span></span><span><span>:</span></span><span><span>30 土木工程</span></span></p><p><span>线上复试具体请关注</span><span>“</span><span>2026下半年推免生接收群</span><span>”（群号：725545745）</span><span>消息</span><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span>3.复试</span></strong><strong><span>接收</span></strong></p><p><span>9月2</span><span>1</span><span>日</span><span>起</span><span><span>：推免生登录推免服务系统进行注册并填报个人资料信息，推免服务系统开放后可填报志愿（推免流程及相关时间安排详见推免服务系统：</span><span>http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm）温馨提示：复试通知和拟录取确认等环节均须通过推免服务系统完成，请各位考生确保学信网上注册的手机处于可用状态，并关注四川农业大学研招网微信公众号的信息推送。</span></span></p><p><span><span>推免生缴纳复试费</span><span>120元，交费网址：</span></span><a href=\"https://op.sicau.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://op.sicau.edu.cn/</span></a><span>  在用户登录这里选择“校外人员登录”（所有来复试的人，不管来自哪里都是校外人员登录），登录用户名：27+手机号；初始密码：身份证号码后6位。</span></p><p><span>9月22日：学院向拟录推免生发出</span><span>复试</span><span>通知；</span><span>推免生登录研招网接收复试通知。</span></p><p><span>9月24日：学院向拟录推免生发出待录取通知；推免生登录研招网接</span><span>收</span><span>待录取，完成网上拟录取流程。</span></p><p><strong><span>4.</span></strong><strong><span>体检</span></strong></p><p><span><span>待复试拟录取名单公示</span><span>10个工作日后，考生自行到二甲及以上等级医院完成体检，将体检报告整理成PDF电子文档，以“体检+拟录取专业名称+姓名”的格式命名该文档和邮件主题后发送到jcxy@sicau.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><strong><span>五</span></strong><strong><span>、申请提前进入硕士研究生阶段学习</span></strong></p><p><span>对于</span><span>202</span><span>7</span><span>年接收的推免研究生，可申请提前进入硕士研究生阶段学习，具体说明如下：</span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>推免生在完成中国研招网待录取后，即可申请提前进入硕士研究生阶段学习。提前进入硕士研究生学习阶段，未取得研究生学籍前免缴研究生学费，发放推免生奖学金和助学金。</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>提前入学</span><span>报名</span><span>：</span><span>有意愿申请提前进入硕士阶段学习的推免生，请下载《附件：推免生申请提前进入硕士研究生阶段学习申请表》</span><span>，</span><span><span>为方便选课</span><span>,</span></span><span><span>请在</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>28</span></span><span><span><span>日上午</span><span>12:00前，将</span></span></span><span><span>提前入学申请表</span></span><span><span>纸质档交</span></span><span><span>到</span></span><span><span>学院</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>C311</span></span><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span>六</span></strong><strong><span>、</span></strong><strong><span>其他事项</span></strong></p><p><span>1.其他事宜，以</span><span>四川农业大学</span><span><span>《关于</span><span>2027年接收推免研究生（含直博生）工作的通知</span></span><span>》为准</span><span>，请务必认真仔细阅读：</span><span><span>（</span><span>https://yan.sicau.edu.cn/info/1025/18969.htm）</span></span></p><p><span>2</span><span>.学院研究生导师情况介绍：</span><span><span>https://yzb.sicau.edu.cn/dscx/dscx.aspx</span></span></p><p><span>3</span><span>.</span><span>学院</span><span>工作</span><span><span>联系人：张老师</span><span> 028-87124710，</span></span><span>地点：</span><span>2</span><span>C311</span></p><p><span>纪检</span><span>监督：</span><span><span>付书记，</span><span>028</span></span><span>-</span><span>87298657</span><span><span>，地址：</span><span>2C308</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span>四川农业大学</span><span>建筑与城乡规划学院</span></p><p><span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span><span>9月</span></span><span>17</span><span>日</span></p><p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"c403af1fb5914f2bb03b550daddee444c70c43b07f768f1dd699cb2796c018fd","textLength":2008,"sourceSha256":"dbe1a35eaf95e81c4e6c007b8da638c1c9bb7c4771c58adcaec3b0a3b583afc8","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件1-2027年招收推免研究生复试、录取工作办法（校研发【2026】37号）.pdf","url":"https://jg.sicau.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1850364842&wbfileid=58607017B25BB443ECC9D886F4EB489A"},{"name":"附件2-思想政治素质与品德考核表.doc","url":"https://jg.sicau.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1850364842&wbfileid=E4AE68149DB9893A4CFE5DC960225E2B"},{"name":"附件3：远程复试考场规则.pdf","url":"https://jg.sicau.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1850364842&wbfileid=1B1C8E18A6C9520601376FB4CAC9555B"},{"name":"附件4：推免生申请提前进入硕士研究生阶段学习申请表.docx","url":"https://jg.sicau.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1850364842&wbfileid=C597029229BBAD4127DE19210E0C277A"},{"name":"附件5：诚信复试承诺书.docx","url":"https://jg.sicau.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1850364842&wbfileid=4A9DC1EAB7549DCF33B48CBE3FB98D64"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-7d3a9b4c59079d4c411a","title":"2026年四川农业大学建筑与城乡规划学院2027年接收推免研究生工作的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:33.019927+00:00"}
